  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。クセが　少ないので　いろいろな食材と組み合わせて　楽しむことが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 나는 식재료. 개성이 강하지 않아서 다양한 식재료와 조합해서 즐길 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有苦味的食材。沒有什麼特殊的味道，所以能和其他各式各樣的食材搭配享用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût amer. Sa saveur simple lui permet de se combiner avec toutes sortes d’aliments.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dank ihres relativ schlichten Geschmacks kann diese bittere Zutat wunderbar mit den unterschiedlichsten anderen Zutaten kombiniert werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene un sabor muy suave con un ligero toque amargo, lo que hace que se pueda disfrutar como acompañamiento de casi cualquier otro ingrediente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente amaro. Il suo sapore semplice permette un gradevole abbinamento con tanti altri ingredienti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This bitter-tasting ingredient is simple and straightforward—just add it to all kinds of other ingredients for a delightfully crunchy time.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。クセが　少ないので　いろいろな食材と組み合わせて　楽しむことが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带苦味的食材。因为味道朴素，所以能与各种食材搭配享用。",
